(810, 3, 114, 10, 1, '2025-12-19', 'Episode 10', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(811, 4, 117, 1, 1, '2025-09-11', 'I\'m going for a thin waffle', 'Tynnvaffel går jeg for', 1, 706, 'Pernille Sørensen says “I\'m going for a thin waffle” during her attempt at the ‘Fry a waffle in the waffle iron’ task.', 'In this season premiere, the contestants must bring in their best accessories, pour some glasses of champagne back into a bottle, put the most snowman in a bottle, fry a waffle in a ceiling-mounted waffle iron, and build a tower while blindfolded.', NULL, 'A warm welcome to season 12! Twelve, guys! Here from Drammen Theatre. This wondrous show that no-one leaves without a mark.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'And one who never leaves the show, despite his soul being full of scars, draining wounds, and dried scabies, it\'s you, my favourite, Olli Wermskog.', NULL, 'Who would have thought that after one show in season 12, we\'ve taught you that a ladle is a better tool than a set of bellows, when it comes to making waffles?', NULL, '|703|', '|703|', NULL, NULL, 'kongen_befaler_12_01_framed.png', 'kongen_befaler_12_01_metatag.jpg', 'kongen_befaler_12_01_thumb.jpg', 'Image of the title card at the start of this episode, showing a task brief with the show title, \'Kongen Befaler\', and the episode title, \'Tynnvaffel går jeg for\' [\'I\'m going for a thin waffle\'], on a wooden desk. At the edges of the image, part of a typewriter keyboard and a stack of leather-bound books can be seen.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(812, 4, 117, 2, 1, '2025-09-18', 'Yeah, it’ll be redcurrants in the nose', 'Ja, det blir rips i nesa', 1, 707, 'Thomas Numme says “Yeah, it’ll be redcurrants in the nose” during his attempt at the ‘Put the most marbles in the thimble, or redcurrants in your nose’ task.', 'In this episode, the contestants must bring in something overrated, throw a towel through a window, put the most marbles in a thimble or redcurrants in their nose, prank themselves, and collect the most rubber ducks in their hats.', NULL, 'Good morning. Welcome to Kongen Befaler. We just got up.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'First out of bed, that was you. [Olli: That’s right. New day, new opportunities.] Olli Wermskog.', NULL, 'There’s always a better solution than redcurrants in your nose.', NULL, '|705|', '|705|', NULL, NULL, 'kongen_befaler_12_02_framed.png', 'kongen_befaler_12_02_metatag.jpg', 'kongen_befaler_12_02_thumb.jpg', 'Image of the title card at the start of this episode, showing a task brief with the show title, \'Kongen Befaler\', and the episode title, \'Ja, det blir rips i nesa\' [\'Yeah, it’ll be redcurrants in the nose\'], on a wooden desk. At the edges of the image, part of a typewriter keyboard and a stack of leather-bound books can be seen.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(813, 4, 117, 3, 1, '2025-09-25', 'Is this good enough?', 'Er dette bra nok?', 1, 707, 'Thomas Numme asks “Is this good enough?” during his attempt at the ‘Burn the candle at as many ends as possible’ task.', 'In this episode, the contestants must bring in something they’ve given up on, put all of the balls in the garden in the outhouse, burn a candle at as many ends as possible, set a party table while dancing the jenka, and win a game of ‘kick the can’.', NULL, 'A warm welcome to Kongen Befaler, where brilliance and stupidity live in symbiosis.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'By my side, the love child of brilliance and stupidity, Olli Wermskog.', NULL, 'To you kids at home, if you\'re going to take one thing from this show, it\'s: When it comes to filling the loo, slow and steady wins the race.', NULL, '|706|', '|706|', NULL, NULL, 'kongen_befaler_12_03_framed.png', 'kongen_befaler_12_03_metatag.jpg', 'kongen_befaler_12_03_thumb.jpg', 'Image of the title card at the start of this episode, showing a task brief with the show title, \'Kongen Befaler\', and the episode title, \'Er dette bra nok?\' [\'Is this good enough?\'], on a wooden desk. At the edges of the image, part of a typewriter keyboard and a stack of leather-bound books can be seen.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(814, 4, 117, 4, 1, '2025-10-02', 'Lots and lots of blood', 'Masse masse blod', 1, 704, 'Ina Svenningdal indicates that she’s collected “Lots and lots of blood” during her attempt at the ‘Fill this dish with blood, sweat, or tears’ task.', 'In this episode, the contestants must: bring in something that’s not dinner; tell the best joke; fill a petri dish with blood, sweat, or tears; hit a meatball into a golf hole while some dogs are set loose in the garden; and play a game of balloon roulette.', NULL, 'Hello, at home. Welcome to Kongen Befaler, the show that has taken five people’s clumsy and ingenious solutions to carefully formulated tasks to become top-notch entertainment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'And top-notch entertainment doesn’t come without meticulous effort from my noble entertainment doula, Olli Wermskog.', NULL, 'Today, we’ve finally concluded that tears and urine aren’t the same, so don’t urinate over spilled milk.', NULL, '|704|', '|704|', NULL, NULL, 'kongen_befaler_12_04_framed.png', 'kongen_befaler_12_04_metatag.jpg', 'kongen_befaler_12_04_thumb.jpg', 'Image of the title card at the start of this episode, showing a task brief with the show title, \'Kongen Befaler\', and the episode title, \'Masse masse blod\' [\'Lots and lots of blood\'], on a wooden desk. At the edges of the image, part of a typewriter keyboard and a stack of leather-bound books can be seen.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(815, 4, 117, 5, 1, '2025-10-09', 'Forward-heavy tower', 'Framtungt tårn', 1, 706, 'Pernille Sørensen describes her creation as a “Forward-heavy tower”, during the ‘Transport a swimming toy on top of a tower from A to B’ task.', 'In this episode, the contestants must bring in something that they’re proud to have made, get as far as they can in a swivel chair, shrink a jumper, transport a swimming toy on top of a tower from ‘A’ to ‘B’, and scrump for coins in Atle’s garden.', NULL, 'Welcome to Kongen Befaler, which makes you think about all the good that resides in man…', NULL, NULL, NULL, '…but also to contemplate all the self-destructive, distant, and pedantic things that reside in Olli Wermskog.', NULL, 'Remember, towers work best at heights. We\'ll be back next time.', NULL, '|703|', '|703|', NULL, NULL, 'kongen_befaler_12_05_framed.png', 'kongen_befaler_12_05_metatag.jpg', 'kongen_befaler_12_05_thumb.jpg', 'Image of the title card at the start of this episode, showing a task brief with the show title, \'Kongen Befaler\', and the episode title, \'Framtungt tårn\' [\'Forward-heavy tower\'], on a wooden desk. At the edges of the image, part of a typewriter keyboard and a stack of leather-bound books can be seen.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(816, 4, 117, 6, 1, '2025-10-16', 'But I but but yeah well it\'s that one then', 'Men jeg men men den er vel er den ja', 1, 704, 'Ina Svenningdal stutters “But I but but yeah well it’s that one then” after reading the task brief in the ‘Get the balloon into the bucket’ task.', 'In this episode, the contestants must bring in something that should be bigger, get a balloon into a bucket in the middle of a pool, make an omelette using unique tools, get some footballs into a freezer, and serve Atle slices of bread with cheese spread.', NULL, 'A warm welcome to Kongen Befaler. Enough light-footed jibber-jabber for today.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This man knows to appreciate an effective start: Olli Wermskog.', NULL, 'Today, we’ve seen that sloppiness can pay off. We’ll be back next time. If you enjoyed this show, you’re going to love the next one. See you.', NULL, '|705|', '|705|', NULL, NULL, 'kongen_befaler_12_06_framed.png', 'kongen_befaler_12_06_metatag.jpg', 'kongen_befaler_12_06_thumb.jpg', 'Image of the title card at the start of this episode, showing a task brief with the show title, \'Kongen Befaler\', and the episode title, \'Men jeg men men den er vel er den ja\' [\'But I but but yeah well it\'s that one then\'], on a wooden desk. At the edges of the image, part of a typewriter keyboard and a stack of leather-bound books can be seen.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(817, 4, 117, 7, 1, '2025-10-23', 'Cat being squeezed', 'Katt som klemmes', 1, 706, 'Pernille Sørensen decides that her sound effect should be “Cat being squeezed”, during the ‘Make a video using all of the sound effects’ task.', 'In this episode, the contestants must bring in something from a closed chapter, catapult something into the fountain, erase as much of an eraser as possible, make a video using their own custom sound effects, and win a game of ‘Broomstick or no broomstick?’.', NULL, 'Welcome to Kongen Befaler, the Rolls-Royce of comedy shows, where unprepared contestants solve tasks for no other purpose than to entertain us.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'And that same introduction goes to you, Olli Wermskog.', NULL, 'That’s it for today. Remember, all that glitters is not gold. All that throws is not a catapult.', NULL, '|707|', '|707|', NULL, NULL, 'kongen_befaler_12_07_framed.png', 'kongen_befaler_12_07_metatag.jpg', 'kongen_befaler_12_07_thumb.jpg', 'Image of the title card at the start of this episode, showing a task brief with the show title, \'Kongen Befaler\', and the episode title, \'Katt som klemmes\' [\'Cat being squeezed\'], on a wooden desk. At the edges of the image, part of a typewriter keyboard and a stack of leather-bound books can be seen.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(818, 4, 117, 8, 1, '2025-10-30', 'Take back the Sunday', 'Ta tilbake sønda\'n', 1, 707, 'Thomas Numme yells out his rule “Take back the Sunday!” from the balcony, during his attempt at the ‘Break your own rule’ task.', 'In this episode, the contestants must bring in something rather sad, make and then break their own rule, put something impressive in a bottle, document that they saved the day, and communicate animals to the Taskmaster using only sounds.', NULL, 'A warm welcome to Kongen Befaler, from Drammen theatre. It is your king of the evening speaking.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The fool who has been allowed at the king\'s table is also here: Olli Wermskog.', NULL, 'Today, we learned that the best way to save the day is with cauliflower soup and fireworks.', NULL, '|704|', '|704|', NULL, NULL, 'kongen_befaler_12_08_framed.png', 'kongen_befaler_12_08_metatag.jpg', 'kongen_befaler_12_08_thumb.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(819, 4, 117, 9, 1, '2025-11-06', 'Cactus, ow-ow-ow-ow!', 'Kaktus, au-au-au-au!', 1, 706, 'Pernille Sørensen exclaims “Cactus, ow-ow-ow-ow!” during her attempt at the ‘Pop the most balloons from the balcony’ task.', 'In this episode, the contestants must bring in a solution that’s too easy, pop the most balloons from the balcony, remain frozen in a pose for the second longest time, catch a whole family of badgers in something, and jump over a series of animals without breaking their flatbread.', NULL, 'A warm welcome to Kongen Befaler, and this year’s big climb towards next week’s final, where this bust in gold of me is about to find a new owner.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'One who will not find a new owner: the man who’s never climbed physically or socially, Olli Wermskog.', NULL, 'We’ve learnt today that five badgers fit in a big pot.', NULL, '|703|', '|703|', NULL, NULL, 'kongen_befaler_12_09_framed.png', 'kongen_befaler_12_09_metatag.jpg', 'kongen_befaler_12_09_thumb.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(820, 4, 117, 10, 1, '2025-11-13', 'You are so daft, Olli!', 'Du er så teit, Olli!', 1, 704, 'Ina Svenningdal says “You’re so daft, Olli!” during her attempt at the ‘Do something physical as many times as possible in three minutes’ task.', 'In this season finale, the contestants must bring in something that empties quickly, do something physical as many times as possible in three minutes, move the most ice balls from the lab to the fountain, lip sync the chorus of a song, and then retrieve one of the coloured ping-pong balls. In a thrilling season tie-breaker, three of the contestants must then find their doppelganger in the theatre audience.', NULL, 'A warm welcome to the finale of Kongen Befaler season 12 from Drammen\'s Theatre! Through nine episodes, the contestants have collected points to put in their basket. Today, it will be decided who has the most points in their basket and will get their hands on the grand prize. A surprise. A bust in gold of me.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'With us on this journey, my first mate, pilot, and fellow Finn, Olli Wermskog.', NULL, 'Remember, you\'re not just someONE, you\'re someTHING too.', NULL, '|707|', '|707|', NULL, NULL, 'kongen_befaler_12_10_framed.png', 'kongen_befaler_12_10_metatag.jpg', 'kongen_befaler_12_10_thumb.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(821, 13, 113, 1, 1, '2025-09-11', 'A kickass party', 'Un beau party', 1, 634, 'While brainstorming ingredient ideas during the ‘Create an edible sculpture’ task, Marie-Soleil Dion considers ordering a gram of pot. When Antoine reminds her that she would need 150 grams, Marie-Soleil counters that such an amount would make for “a kickass party”.', 'In this episode, one contestant brings in the best sculpted thing, and everyone must create an edible sculpture (and then eat it), build a tower out of tin cans while blindfolded, put the largest thing inside of a balloon, and completely unroll a roll of sticky tape.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Please save your applause for the comedians who will be spending this fourth season with us. Allow me to introduce them to you.', NULL, 'For a fourth year running, he’ll be my arms, my head, my legs... but I don’t want him to be my hair. Antoine Vézina!', NULL, NULL, NULL, '|691|', '|691|', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
